// Topic: Arrays and embedded documents
// Collection: learning_mongo.profiles, learning_mongo.tours, learning_mongo.users
// Shows: dot notation, $elemMatch, $size/$expr, $addToSet

use("learning_mongo");

// Embedded field via dot notation
db.profiles.find({ "work.company": { $exists: true } }, { "profile.name": 1, work: 1, _id: 0 });

db.profiles.find({ "work.experience": { $gte: 2 } }, { "profile.name": 1, _id: 0 });

// Array contains value
db.tours.find({ tourTags: "hiking" }, { tourName: 1, tourTags: 1, _id: 0 });

// Array length >= 2 via $expr + $size
db.profiles.find(
  { $expr: { $gte: [{ $size: "$languages" }, 2] } },
  { "profile.name": 1, languages: 1, _id: 0 }
).sort({ "profile.name": 1 });

// Nested friend documents on users
db.users.find({ "friends.is_programmer": true });

// $addToSet keeps array unique
db.tours.updateOne(
  { tourName: "Big Sur Retreat" },
  { $addToSet: { tourTags: "coastal" } }
);

db.tours.findOne({ tourName: "Big Sur Retreat" }, { tourName: 1, tourTags: 1, _id: 0 });
